Lot 1 (Units 1, 2, and 5): Unit 1, 2 and 5: Energized. Minor works are remaining. Physical progress: 99.5%.

Lot 1A (Units 3 and 6): Unit 3: Energized and in operation. Physical progress: 100%. Unit 6: Energized.

Lot 2 and 2A (Rehabilitation works of switchyards of HPP):

Lot 2: Works are completed. Completion certificate and OPAC are issued.

Lot 2A: Works under the contract completed. All works are completed at Rudaki substation, 110kV transmission line and at Vose S/S.</narrative>
